`orgPreferences` was removed from scratch-org definition files; everything now lives under a top-level `settings` object whose keys are Metadata API Settings types, with their real field names. I mapped each legacy preference to its current setting:

| Legacy preference | Metadata setting |
|---|---|
| `S1DesktopEnabled` (enabled) | `mobileSettings.enableS1DesktopEnabled: true` |
| `ChatterEnabled` (enabled) | `chatterSettings.enableChatter: true` |
| `NetworksEnabled` (enabled) | `communitiesSettings.enableNetworksEnabled: true` |
| `Translation` (enabled) | `languageSettings.enableTranslationWorkbench: true` |
